+# ZECKED vendored copy of zcash_protocol 0.10.4
+
+This directory is `zcash_protocol` 0.10.4 exactly as published on crates.io, plus
+one backport from `zcash_protocol` 0.11.0-pre.0 (librustzcash, 2026-09-30), kept
+behind the same `--cfg zcash_unstable="nu7"` flag that upstream 0.10.x used:
+
+- `TestNetwork` activates `NetworkUpgrade::Nu7` at height `4465026`
+  (`MainNetwork` still has no NU7 height).
+- `BranchId::Nu7` maps to and from consensus branch id `0x77190AD9` (ZIP 259)
+  instead of the placeholder `0xFFFFFFFF`.
+- `src/lib.rs` refuses to compile without the `nu7` cfg.
+- Unit tests `nu7_branch_id_is_zip259_value`, `nu7_activates_on_testnet_only`,
+  `nu_ordering_testnet` pin those values.
+
+Nothing else is changed. See `../README.md`. The upstream changelog follows.
+
 # Changelog
 All notable changes to this library will be documented in this file.
 
